00:38:14,260 --> 00:38:17,180
The aircraft as well as the airports will be smart,

432
00:38:17,660 --> 00:38:19,880
meaning the computers will be able to speak to each other,

433
00:38:20,440 --> 00:38:23,080
making takeoffs and landings the business of computers,

434
00:38:23,660 --> 00:38:25,720
not air traffic controllers and pilots.

